istory.html\">History of pypdf</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"meta/CONTRIBUTORS.html\">Contributors</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"meta/scope-of-pypdf.html\">Scope of pypdf</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"meta/comparisons.html\">pypdf vs X</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"meta/faq.html\">Frequently Asked Questions</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <section data-toggle=\"wy-nav-shift\" class=\"wy-nav-content-wrap\">\n<nav class=\"wy-nav-top\" aria-label=\"Mobile navigation menu\">\n          <i data-toggle=\"wy-nav-top\" class=\"fa fa-bars\"></i>\n          <a href=\"#\">pypdf</a>\n      </nav>\n\n      <div class=\"wy-nav-content\">\n        <div class=\"rst-content\">\n          <div role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"Page navigation\">\n  <ul class=\"wy-breadcrumbs\">\n      <li>\n<a href=\"#\" class=\"icon icon-home\" aria-label=\"Home\">\n</a>\n</li>\n      <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\">\nWelcome to pypdf\n</li>\n      <li class=\"wy-breadcrumbs-aside\">\n            <a href=\"_sources/index.rst.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"> View page source</a>\n      </li>\n  </ul>\n  <hr>\n</div>\n          <div role=\"main\" class=\"document\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n           <div itemprop=\"articleBody\">\n             \n  <section id=\"welcome-to-pypdf\">\n<h1>\nWelcome to pypdf\n<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#welcome-to-pypdf\" title=\"Link to this heading\"></a>\n</h1>\n<p>\npypdf is a \n<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Free_software\">free</a>\n and open\nsource pure-python PDF library capable of splitting,\nmerging, cropping, and transforming the pages of PDF files. It can also add\ncustom data, viewing options, and passwords to PDF files.\npypdf can retrieve text and metadata from PDFs as well.\n</p>\n<p>\nSee \n<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/py-pdf/pdfly\">pdfly</a>\n for a CLI application that uses pypdf to interact with PDFs.\n</p>\n<p>\nYou can contribute to \n<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf\">pypdf on GitHub</a>\n.\n</p>\n<div class=\"toctree-wrapper compound\">\n<p class=\"caption\" role=\"heading\">\n<span class=\"caption-text\">User Guide</span>\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/installation.html\">Installation</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/robustness.html\">Robustness and strict=False</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/security.html\">Security</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/suppress-warnings.html\">Exceptions, Warnings, and Log messages</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/metadata.html\">Metadata</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/extract-text.html\">Extract Text from a PDF</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/post-processing-in-text-extraction.html\">Post-Processing of Text Extraction</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/extract-images.html\">Extract Images</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/handle-attachments.html\">Handle Attachments</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/encryption-decryption.html\">Encryption and Decryption of PDFs</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/merging-pdfs.html\">Merging PDF files</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/cropping-and-transforming.html\">Cropping and Transforming PDFs</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/reading-pdf-annotations.html\">Reading PDF Annotations</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/adding-pdf-annotations.html\">Adding PDF Annotations</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/add-watermark.html\">Adding a Stamp or Watermark to a PDF</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/add-javascript.html\">Adding JavaScript to a PDF</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/viewer-preferences.html\">Adding Viewer Preferences</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/forms.html\">Interactions with PDF Forms</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/handling-outlines.html\">Handling Outlines</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/streaming-data.html\">Streaming Data with pypdf</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/file-size.html\">Reduce PDF File Size</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/pdf-version-support.html\">PDF Version Support</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"user/pdfa-compliance.html\">PDF/A Compliance</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"toctree-wrapper compound\">\n<p class=\"caption\" role=\"heading\">\n<span class=\"caption-text\">API Reference</span>\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"modules/PdfReader.html\">The PdfReader Class</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"modules/PdfWriter.html\">The PdfWriter Class</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\">\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"modules/Destination.html\">The Destination Class</a>\n</li>\n<li cl